dolen

Qwen3 / Qwen3.5 / Qwen3.6 / Gemma4-Universal / IBM-Granite 4.1 inference in C, based originally on "Qwen3.c" [https://github.com/adriancable/qwen3.c] and "Qwen3.5.c" [https://github.com/kroggen/qwen3.5-c]

Currently supports non-MoE and text only.

Derived ultimately from "llama2.c" [https://github.com/karpathy/llama2.c] by Andrej Karpathy.

